{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05176","headline":"桐竹赠张燕公 · 李伯鱼","name":"桐竹赠张燕公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"北竹青桐北，南桐绿竹南。\n竹林君早爱，桐树我初贪。\n凤栖桐不媿，凤食竹何慙。\n栖食更如此，余非凤所堪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李伯鱼","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05176.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05176","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}